{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14300","headline":"留守府酬皇甫曙侍御弹琴之什 · 窦庠","name":"留守府酬皇甫曙侍御弹琴之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青琐昼无尘，碧梧阴似水。\n高张朱弦琴，静举白玉指。\n洞箫又奏繁，寒磬一声起。\n鹤警风露中，泉飞雪云里。\n泠泠分雅郑，析析谐宫徵。\n座客无俗心，巢禽亦倾耳。\n卫国知有人，齐竽偶相齿。\n有时趋绦纱，尽日随朱履。\n那令杂繁手，出假求焦尾。\n几载遗正音，今朝自君始。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦庠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}